21\"front|strong=\"H6440\"into|strong=\"H5927\"the|strong=\"H6440\"eastern|strong=\"H6931\"sea|strong=\"H3220\",  \nand|strong=\"H6440\"its|strong=\"H5921\"back|strong=\"H5927\"into|strong=\"H5927\"the|strong=\"H6440\"western|strong=\"H3220\"sea|strong=\"H3220\";  \nand|strong=\"H6440\"its|strong=\"H5921\"stench will|strong=\"H3220\"come|strong=\"H5927\"up|strong=\"H5927\",  \nand|strong=\"H6440\"its|strong=\"H5921\"bad smell|strong=\"H6709\"will|strong=\"H3220\"rise|strong=\"H5927\".”  \nSurely|strong=\"H3588\"he|strong=\"H3588\"has|strong=\"H3588\"done|strong=\"H6213\"great|strong=\"H1431\"things|strong=\"H1431\".   \n"},{"number":21,"text":"Land, don’t be|strong=\"H3068\"afraid|strong=\"H3372\".  \nBe|strong=\"H3068\"glad|strong=\"H8055\"and|strong=\"H3068\"rejoice|strong=\"H8055\", for|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has|strong=\"H3068\"done|strong=\"H6213\"great|strong=\"H1431\"things|strong=\"H1431\".   \n"},{"number":22,"text":"Don’t be|strong=\"H5414\"afraid|strong=\"H3372\", you|strong=\"H3588\"animals of|strong=\"H7704\"the|strong=\"H3588\"field|strong=\"H7704\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"pastures|strong=\"H4999\"of|strong=\"H7704\"the|strong=\"H3588\"wilderness|strong=\"H4057\"spring|strong=\"H1876\"up|strong=\"H5375\",  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"tree|strong=\"H6086\"bears|strong=\"H5375\"its|strong=\"H5414\"fruit|strong=\"H6529\".  \nThe|strong=\"H3588\"fig|strong=\"H8384\"tree|strong=\"H6086\"and|strong=\"H6086\"the|strong=\"H3588\"vine|strong=\"H1612\"yield|strong=\"H5414\"their|strong=\"H5375\"strength|strong=\"H2428\".   \n"},{"number":23,"text":"“Be|strong=\"H3068\"glad|strong=\"H8055\"then|strong=\"H5414\", you|strong=\"H3588\"children|strong=\"H1121\"of|strong=\"H1121\"Zion|strong=\"H6726\",  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"rejoice|strong=\"H8055\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", your|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H3068\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"he|strong=\"H3588\"gives|st