H5971\"has|strong=\"H3068\"dealt|strong=\"H6213\"wondrously|strong=\"H6381\"with|strong=\"H5973\"you|strong=\"H6213\";  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"people|strong=\"H5971\"will|strong=\"H3068\"never|strong=\"H3808\"again be|strong=\"H3808\"disappointed.   \n"},{"number":27,"text":"You|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"know|strong=\"H3045\"that|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"am|strong=\"H3068\"among|strong=\"H7130\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\",  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"that|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"am|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", your|strong=\"H3068\"God|strong=\"H3068\", and|strong=\"H3478\"there|strong=\"H3045\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no|strong=\"H3808\"one|strong=\"H3808\"else|strong=\"H5750\";  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"my|strong=\"H3068\"people|strong=\"H5971\"will|strong=\"H3068\"never|strong=\"H3808\"again|strong=\"H5750\"be|strong=\"H3808\"disappointed.   \n"},{"number":28,"text":"“It will happen afterward, that I will pour out my Spirit on all flesh;  \nand your sons and your daughters will prophesy.  \nYour old men will dream dreams.  \nYour young men will see visions.   \n"},{"number":29,"text":"And also on the servants and on the handmaids in those days,  \nI will pour out my Spirit.   \n"},{"number":30,"text":"I will show wonders in the heavens and in the earth:  \nblood, fire, and pillars of smoke.   \n"},{"number":31,"text":"The sun will be turned into darkness,  \nand the moon into blood,  \nbefore the great and terrible day of the LORD|strong=\"H3068\"comes.   \n"},{"number":32,"text":"It will happen that whoever will call on the LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s name shall be saved;  \nfor in Mount Zion and in Jerusalem there will be those who escape,  \nas the LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has said,  \nand among the remnant, those whom the LORD|strong=\"H3068\"calls.   \n"}]}
